----------------------------------------------------------------------
Noise suppression (engine/src/denoise): nnnoiseless / RNNoise
----------------------------------------------------------------------
The denoiser in engine/src/denoise is the core of the nnnoiseless crate 0.5.2
(https://github.com/jneem/nnnoiseless), a Rust port of RNNoise, with the FFT
replaced by denoise/fft.rs. Its licence follows.

